{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-markdown-remark-js","path":"/hitchhikers-guide/apps/docs/content/observatorium/thanos/thanos_programmatic_access.md","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Operate First"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"61b9ab4b-a07b-55e3-8351-1fc7b2db0c1e","html":"<h1 id=\"thanos-programmatic-access\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#thanos-programmatic-access\" aria-label=\"thanos programmatic access permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Thanos Programmatic Access</h1>\n<p>The Thanos metrics can be queried using the <a href=\"https://prometheus-api-client-python.readthedocs.io/\">this</a> Python client library.\nYou can install the latest version with <code class=\"language-text\">pip install prometheus-api-client</code>.\nYou will need to extract the OpenShift bearer token for the client library to authenticate the <a href=\"https://thanos-query-frontend-opf-observatorium.apps.smaug.na.operate-first.cloud/\">thanos</a> instance.</p>\n<h3 id=\"personal-token\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#personal-token\" aria-label=\"personal token permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Personal token</h3>\n<p>You can use your personal token for testing and ad-hoc scripts, but it will expire in ~24 hours.</p>\n<ol class=\"pf-c-list\">\n<li>Login to <a href=\"https://console-openshift-console.apps.smaug.na.operate-first.cloud/\">https://console-openshift-console.apps.smaug.na.operate-first.cloud/</a> using <code class=\"language-text\">operate-first</code> login</li>\n<li>Copy the token from the User dropdown menu</li>\n<li>\n<p>Use this token as your oauth bearer token when connecting to Thanos via the client library</p>\n<ul class=\"pf-c-list\">\n<li>\n<p>Eg:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"python\"><pre class=\"language-python\"><code class=\"language-python\">prometheus_api_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>prometheus_connect<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>PrometheusConnect<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\nurl<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'https://thanos-query-frontend-opf-observatorium.apps.smaug.na.operate-first.cloud'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\nheaders<span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>“Authorization”<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> “Bearer my_oauth_token_to_the_host”<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\ndisable_ssl<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The metric data can be extracted locally using the prometheus client in a Jupyter notebook</p>\n<ul class=\"pf-c-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/aicoe-aiops/time-series/blob/master/notebooks/ts-1-fetching-metrics.ipynb\">Sample notebook</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>You can also spawn and run your notebooks on <a href=\"https://jupyterhub-opf-jupyterhub.apps.smaug.na.operate-first.cloud/\">JupyterHub</a></li>\n</ol>","fields":{"srcLink":"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/blob/master/docs/content/observatorium/thanos/thanos_programmatic_access.md"},"frontmatter":{"title":"","description":null,"extraClasses":null,"banner":null}}},"pageContext":{"id":"61b9ab4b-a07b-55e3-8351-1fc7b2db0c1e"}},"staticQueryHashes":["117426894","1764348645","3000541721","3606484676"]}